# Module ownership for parallel development.
#
# Two people working the same week in one repository need conflicts prevented by
# ownership, not resolved by conversation. Each path below has exactly one owner
# who may change it without coordination. Touching a file you do not own is
# allowed, but the owner must review it.
#
# Replace the placeholders with the two GitHub handles before enabling reviews.

